{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05321","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 解琬","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑞塔临初地，金舆幸上方。\n空边有清净，觉处无馨香。\n雨霁微尘歛，风秋定水凉。\n兹辰采仙菊，荐寿庆重阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"解琬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}